hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1658","\n Muhammad ibn Bashshar narrated to us, Muhammad ibn Ja'far narrated to us, Shu'bah narrated to us. [In another narration:] Muhammad ibn Bashshar narrated to us, Ibn Abi 'Adi narrated to us, from Sa'id. [In another narration:] Yahya ibn Hakim narrated to us, Abu Bahr narrated to us, Sa'id ibn Abi 'Arubah narrated to us. [In another narration:] Ali ibn Khushram narrated to us,"
